This project uses a multi-license model separating source code, custom assets,
third-party fonts, and compiled binaries:

1. SOURCE CODE (`**/src/main/java/` and `compat/profiles/**/java/`)
   All Java source code is licensed under the MIT License (full text below).

2. ASSETS & AUDIO (`**/src/main/resources/assets/`, `assets/`, and
   corresponding asset adapters in `compat/profiles/**/resources/assets/`)
