   All custom sound effects (.ogg), audio arrangements, visual assets, and mod
   branding are proprietary. Extracting, modifying, or reusing these assets in
   standalone projects without explicit written permission is prohibited.

3. THIRD-PARTY FONTS
   The bundled "Bebas Neue" font retains its original SIL Open Font License
   (OFL 1.1). Its font file and license notice are excluded from the ARR terms.

4. DISTRIBUTION & MODPACKS
   - Modpacks: Inclusion in modpacks is permitted, provided the modpack
     references the official CurseForge/Modrinth release and does not
     monetize this mod directly.
   - Third-Party Re-uploads: Standalone redistribution of compiled `.jar`
     files on third-party websites or mod platforms (CurseForge, Modrinth,
     9Minecraft, etc.) without explicit permission is strictly prohibited.

The source and asset paths above apply across all loader and Minecraft-version
modules in this repository, including ports/.

The distribution restrictions above apply to the bundled mod and its proprietary
assets; they do not remove the permissions granted for MIT-licensed Java code.
These updated terms do not revoke rights granted for copies previously published
under an earlier license. Preserve all applicable third-party license notices.

